    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/311da8ed34766118741eb936a4299b75.avif?t=1755449100\" width=758 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/7f8e7d8e9da5fc9a5482123685afd0e9.avif?t=1755449100\" width=990 height=677 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/3a35eab5d8a5436e0a7c59c1476efff1.poster.avif?t=1755449100\" width=780 height=2286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/3a35eab5d8a5436e0a7c59c1476efff1.webm?t=1755449100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/3a35eab5d8a5436e0a7c59c1476efff1.mp4?t=1755449100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/5cdf9e4528c5564a875fb98051fdcd2c.avif?t=1755449100\" width=990 height=862 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A retro futuristic nightmare:</strong> In a dystopian retro-futuristic world, Johann's life shatters when the new regime murders his beloved. Desperate for answers, he joins a resistance group of detectives determined to expose the atrocities committed by this brutal new world order - Aeterna. At his side stands K.L.A.R.A., a mysterious intelligent entity with her own deadly agenda: destroying those who once tried to enslave her.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play like a real detective:</strong> No hand holding, no points of interest. Just you, a crime scene, and your wits. Identify the truly relevant pieces of evidence and write out the correct deduction why these facts are important to the murder case. The only way forward is to convince your companion Klara with your sharp reasoning. Find secret deductions only a few can find.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom in exploration:</strong> Discover hidden compartments, solve intricate puzzles woven into the crime scene, and uncover a conspiracy that goes far deeper than one murder. Keep your eyes peeled for every detail and uncover the truth about the victims... and the atrocities committed by the invading nation of Aeterna.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put yourself to the test:</strong> Experience handwritten dialogues that flow naturally. Instead of clicking preset options, type your own answers and watch as your words determine which path the conversation takes. Apply secret deductions from your crime scene investigation to unlock hidden dialogue routes that most players will never discover. Your detective skills don't just solve cases - they shape every conversation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How do we do this?</strong> We are trying to use LLMs in a more creative way.\u2028\u2028To simplify: we are using them to categorize your input into right or wrong. It will not create any dialogues or content in &quot;Code: 9&quot;. \u2028Think of it like a judge, evaluating your every input and deciding if it's true, false or belonging in the game at all.We do NOT use AI for content generation like 2D, 3D, music, dialogues, or anything else.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/311da8ed34766118741eb936a4299b75.avif?t=1755449100\" width=758 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/7f8e7d8e9da5fc9a5482123685afd0e9.avif?t=1755449100\" width=990 height=677 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/3a35eab5d8a5436e0a7c59c1476efff1.poster.avif?t=1755449100\" width=780 height=2286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/3a35eab5d8a5436e0a7c59c1476efff1.webm?t=1755449100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/3a35eab5d8a5436e0a7c59c1476efff1.mp4?t=1755449100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623630/extras/5cdf9e4528c5564a875fb98051fdcd2c.avif?t=1755449100\" width=990 height=862 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A retro futuristic nightmare:</strong> In a dystopian retro-futuristic world, Johann's life shatters when the new regime murders his beloved. Desperate for answers, he joins a resistance group of detectives determined to expose the atrocities committed by this brutal new world order - Aeterna. At his side stands K.L.A.R.A., a mysterious intelligent entity with her own deadly agenda: destroying those who once tried to enslave her.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play like a real detective:</strong> No hand holding, no points of interest. Just you, a crime scene, and your wits. Identify the truly relevant pieces of evidence and write out the correct deduction why these facts are important to the murder case. The only way forward is to convince your companion Klara with your sharp reasoning. Find secret deductions only a few can find.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom in exploration:</strong> Discover hidden compartments, solve intricate puzzles woven into the crime scene, and uncover a conspiracy that goes far deeper than one murder. Keep your eyes peeled for every detail and uncover the truth about the victims... and the atrocities committed by the invading nation of Aeterna.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put yourself to the test:</strong> Experience handwritten dialogues that flow naturally. Instead of clicking preset options, type your own answers and watch as your words determine which path the conversation takes. Apply secret deductions from your crime scene investigation to unlock hidden dialogue routes that most players will never discover. Your detective skills don't just solve cases - they shape every conversation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How do we do this?</strong> We are trying to use LLMs in a more creative way.\u2028\u2028To simplify: we are using them to categorize your input into right or wrong. It will not create any dialogues or content in &quot;Code: 9&quot;. \u2028Think of it like a judge, evaluating your every input and deciding if it's true, false or belonging in the game at all.We do NOT use AI for content generation like 2D, 3D, music, dialogues, or anything else.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A detective game where a sharp mind and exploring are key. Write out your deductions to validate evidence, refute enemies and uncover secrets. A brutal warmongering nation attacks your home and kills your loved one. Now every murder case might get you closer to her killer with the help of K.L.A.R.A.",
